===== Upgrading =====

Upgrading is done via sysupgrade. There's no TRX file for this specific model, but running ''dd if=firmware.bin of=firmware.trx bs=32 skip=1'' will generate a valid TRX file that can be used to perform the upgrade.

==== Flash Layout ====
<code>Tot mem: 65536 KBytes

CFE mem:    0x80700000 - 0x8079DAC0 (645824)
Data:       0x80732A20 - 0x80737080 (18016)
BSS:        0x80737080 - 0x80737AC0 (2624)
Heap:       0x80737AC0 - 0x8079BAC0 (409600)
Stack:      0x8079BAC0 - 0x8079DAC0 (8192)
Text:       0x80700000 - 0x80732A1C (207388)</code>

